Description: GitHub Actions self-hosted runner
 The GitHub Actions runner listens for and executes workflow jobs on
 self-hosted infrastructure. Installed under /usr/lib/actions-runner, with
 an /usr/bin/actions-runner symlink to run.sh (FHS layout).
